values ('d6e7f8a9-0b1c-4d26-9f56-6a7b8c9d0e26', 'directing-i', 'Directing I', 'Directing I introduces students to the director''s craft as interpretation, leadership, rehearsal design, actor collaboration, visual composition, and production communication. Students move from script analysis and concept work into practical staging exercises and a directed scene project.');

