final scene project asks students to synthesize analysis, concept, casting, rehearsal, staging, actor work, critique, and reflection into a repeatable process.", "children": [{"id": "39fe0707-806c-4953-9988-20944bbb3479", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Scene selection and preparation", "children": [{"id": "41aa6c70-33e1-4ffc-b919-ade2335c7bff", "type": "concept", "title": "Scene criteria"}, {"id": "0428f4d4-f3ca-4226-9fa8-b3447de7dd8a", "type": "concept", "title": "Rights and permissions awareness"}, {"id": "dfd4f994-2e48-4ad2-88f2-2a5263f992bc", "type": "concept", "title": "Cutting and context notes"}], "description": "Students choose material that is rich enough for analysis and manageable within class constraints."}, {"id": "70e0a7d6-9c69-45ec-b48e-48f9ae3eff98", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Rehearsal process", "children": [{"id": "7af84f4e-ba2c-48b7-9e24-0207e4c4a7b0", "type": "concept", "title": "First rehearsal"}, {"id": "ce2e2f1c-5719-47c6-b979-1e4acab8c321", "type": "concept", "title": "Blocking and exploration"}, {"id": "aa1a70e1-aaaa-4499-aad2-bd14ba5979de", "type": "concept", "title": "Run notes and adjustments"}], "description": "The point is to practice directing through an actual room, not only through planning."}, {"id": "1718492c-1282-4077-9b4e-342e1454d4bc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Presentation and critique", "children": [{"id": "f28370d5-0eeb-4e78-8af6-726f861863f0", "type": "concept", "title": "Peer response"}, {"id": "e1c4bd2f-bd2a-4994-be14-b31532db68c6", "type": "concept", "title": "Instructor notes"}, {"id": "bd70bc45-f272-402a-acda-2a3e9f1c63f7", "type": "concept", "title": "Revision priorities"}], "description": "Students learn to receive feedback on both the scene and their directing process."}, {"id": "65742529-0e1a-4ea8-84d0-53ed8b90b111", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Director's portfolio documentation", "children": [{"id": "4391df4a-ec04-4dc0-a373-319a709f1765", "type": "concept", "title": "Concept statement"}, {"id": "d90ec3e3-e4